{"id": 123, "name": "Cici", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/4/4f/Hero1231-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021140820", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Damage", "Regen"], "difficulty": "20", "stats": ["50", "60", "30", "20"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", ""], "story": "A cheerful performer who spreads fun and wonderment wherever she goes.", "skills": [{"name": "Performer's Delight", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6d7f05670808b2e7662aab8303594fc5.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Cici generates a stack of Delight after dealing damage, increasing her Movement Speed by 0.75% and Spell Vamp by 0.75% per stack up to 10 times, doubling the effects at full stacks."}, {"name": "Yo-Yo Blitz", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_35698dd184befabba3199661018bdf38.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 6.5", "desc": "Cici uses Yoyo to continuously attack the nearest enemy within range (prioritizing heroes) for 3.5s, hitting them up to 10 times, and dealing <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> equal to 65 plus 3<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+1.2% Extra Physical Attack)</span>% of the target's Max HP per hit. Cici can move and use other skills during this attack.\n\nIf there is no enemy within range, Yoyo will attack Turrets or the Base instead.\n\nThis skill deals 20% extra damage to Minions."}, {"name": "Buoyant Bounce", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f49eea2c0866fad182a898eedb8afc72.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 9.5", "desc": "Cici leaps to a target location. If she lands on any unit (not including Turrets and Base), she can leap again in the Joystick's direction. If she lands on an enemy with the first leap, she deals 200<span s